.幸不辱命。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/1pxnz4dmxt34cwtvheadus03cfn1xa5.mp3","text":"在此期间，我愿随您的指挥棒行动。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/mr1an2674j1sxdslsi175fjy27c1e4n.mp3","text":"我知道，您懒得出面，所以我去跑腿......这种感觉很熟悉。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/1i6zrx1qpa8sl17r0gn7preqyb45z1n.mp3","text":"乐谱或者作战计划，总得给我一样吧。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/6y1qcz5uet56yv1epspamsxrjhrh0a2.mp3","text":"唔，不和谐音。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/cprfl41iicn1wi4rirh1pgj1xvekgl4.mp3","text":"以低音号开场吗？很少有这样的编排。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/kiqyxf41umk32ovvg0wmzedn77g9w8c.mp3","text":"您的乐团里只有我一支低音号吗？","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/9v63cc5zl2k8s4b1n0mev37ji78lnnr.mp3","text":"我先活动下手指。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/t1ypchazu6dap4z4upsdk6ywtt09txu.mp3","text":"我会在合适的段落加入演奏。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/0sced9wxs7uxc4bs415y8vxw9dpu04k.mp3","text":"听见了吗？这强奏的恢弘气势。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/aam0sxusuk42hg7305gxetio12a3k9c.mp3","text":"感受到了吗？这弱奏的悠扬思绪。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/34/l1ytfyz42ng8cmlx5xpua2fjgemo10o.mp3","text":"凄厉的嚎叫？吹奏失误就会这样。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/93/3e7mgiwxe36pr4cxms4vv4ifysyeury.mp3","text":"再不走，我就用喇叭口杵你们的脸。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/cxjaavsfw1d7v6jgx0zs1u1980q5pfd.mp3","text":"低音号是最难演奏的乐器之一，我有自信，假以时日能有一些造诣。但您像是生来就精通百种乐器的乐手......真不公平啊。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/m4f67hhr712onykm56mlw6gsc63beqq.mp3","text":"您是最具想象力的指挥。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/imt5yi4mz1owdwlx8qb338c4d259ayf.mp3","text":"怎样让乐感保持在最佳状态？练习。演奏有瑕疵只能说明练习得还不够。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/97/o6ypw6uz3xp3p5vwx68tc7527nq2jch.mp3","text":"我们失败了吗？我不觉得。你们这样的人，会将失败也纳入计划，对吧？","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/03gfw02i0t52gjaax7zduyf37l9r8vy.mp3","text":"这里的隔音效果，应该还不错吧？","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/gjy0g5ehacyw7n7gx58orae7evgahq6.mp3","text":"啊~您吓到我了。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/88jezwhgzv48hed9xr88hvsnlw465pv.mp3","text":"博士，我正准备更换低音号的喇叭口，帮我一下。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/dwh6cmhfpszzygxuqzlnjnudlocmvj9.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/tuoe7s8dwrpjxw5vc7cfxv7hmk2tbiq.mp3","text":"当时离开鲁珀坎的时候，离新年只有一个月了。他们说要尽快启程觐见女皇陛下，这样还能赶得上崔林特尔梅的庆典。一路上我都在练习......其实我很喜欢那首曲子。","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/s1wa81fm8ms0hhe82s8dowqvwzt60co.mp3","text":"博士，休息得还好吗？","alt":"voice/char_4109_baslin/cn_042.mp3"}]}}